假设英文句子由若干词构成。下面 C++ 代码统计输出的词数是（ ）。
```cpp
int main() {
    string str = "gEsP is Interesting     !";
    int x = str.length();
    int nwords = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < x; i++)
        if (str[i] == ' ') {
            nwords++;
            while (str[++i] == ' ');
        }
    cout << nwords << endl;
    return 0;
}
```
